sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Owner or admin
  participant App as Owner's app
  participant S as Supabase
  participant F as send-book-invite
  actor I as Invitee
  participant W as Web /invite
  O->>App: invite by email, role member or admin
  App->>S: create_book_invite(tenant, email, role)
  S->>S: book_invite row, token, valid 7 days<br/>a private book becomes shared
  App->>F: send the email (owner or admin only)
  F-->>I: email with the invite link
  I->>W: opens the link
  W->>I: sign in (an account is required, free)
  I->>W: Join
  W->>S: accept_book_invite(token)
  S->>S: checks token, expiry, email → tenant_member row
  Note over I,S: the invitee's app learns the book through sync_all's membership domains (never realtime)
